        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under argon or nitrogen Schlenk conditions, (Ph2SiOH)2O (1; 10.0 mmol, 4.10 g) was dissolved in DME (125 mL) and n-butyllithium (12.4 mL of a 1.6 M solution in n-hexane) was added at 0 °C. The mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature, anhydrous EuCl3 (1.29 g, 5.0 mmol) was added, and stirring was continued for 24 h. The solution was reduced to ~20 mL, precipitated LiCl was removed by filtration, and the filtrate was concentrated to ca. 15 mL. Colorless needles of 2 formed on standing at room temperature.",
